# Optional: If you want to use Mapbox custom vector / street tiles instead of free CartoDB/OpenStreetMap
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.mapbox.com
# 2. Copy your "Default public token" (starts with pk.eyJ...)
# 3. Rename this file to .env and paste your token below:
VITE_MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Optional: Override the base domain used for generating Bottle QR codes (e.g. for manufacturing/stickers)
# By default, it automatically uses the live browser domain (e.g. https://sip-n-go.vercel.app)
# VITE_APP_URL=https://sip-n-go.vercel.app
